The QR reader and writer in this directory are a Kotlin port of ZXing's QR code path:

  ZXing ("Zebra Crossing"), https://github.com/zxing/zxing
  Copyright ZXing authors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-ZXING beside this file)
  Ported from tag zxing-3.5.4, commit f651b0a0375676e47144f73397dddff8868b0e4c

Each file names the upstream files it was ported from, and says what was changed; ZXing's comments are kept where
they explain the algorithm. The port is held to ZXing's own QR black-box corpus at ZXing's own thresholds
(QrCorpusTest; the images fetched by :core:fetchQrCorpus, pinned in src/mobile/core/qr/zxing-corpus.sha256).

